# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: GTKLibs, riscos-gtk's shared libraries.
Package: GTKLibs
Section: Library
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedLibs, SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Resources.!GTKLibs (LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: GTK 3 for RISC OS: the shared libraries riscos-gtk programs use
 GTK 3.24.52, riscos-gtk's RISC OS backend and the 24 libraries under it
 (GLib, Cairo, Pango, HarfBuzz, FreeType and more), as shared libraries
 in !Boot.Resources.!GTKLibs, so every riscos-gtk program shares one
 copy. It also adds the hard-float loader (ld-riscos/so/2) and SOManager
 3.04 to !SharedLibs when it's installed, if !SharedLibs hasn't got them.
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: Resources/!GTKLibs -> Resources/!GTKLibs
Build-Map: Resources/!SharedLibs -> Resources/!GTKLibs/SharedLibs
Build-Trigger: PostInstall triggers/GTKLibs/PostInstall
Build-Notice: GTKLibs, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 GTK, GLib, Pango, Cairo, HarfBuzz and the other libraries are under the
 GNU LGPL 2.1 or later, or MIT-style licences; riscos-gtk's source and
 SDK are on the release page.
 .
 !GTKLibs.SharedLibs holds GCCSDK's SOManager 3.04 ((c) GCCSDK
 Developers) and hard-float dynamic loader, free software from
 riscos.info. The loader derives from Linux's ld.so 1.9.9, Copyright
 (c) 1994-1997 Eric Youngdale, Peter MacDonald, David Engel, Hongjiu Lu
 and Mitch D'Souza, under a BSD-style licence.
 .
 The LGPL follows.
Build-Copyright: Resources/!GTKLibs/LicenceLGPL
